    <string name="library_reinitialize_message">Directory: %1$s\n\nProblem: %2$s\n\nRebuild replaces the library management information, permanently clears the previous internal book entries, translation, OCR, super-resolution and reading records for this directory, then scans the existing manga and novels again.\n\nOriginal manga and novel files stay in place. Other libraries are preserved.\n\nIf directory access has expired, choose the directory again to grant access. Cancel if you need the old records; clearing them cannot be undone.</string>
